  "selection": "All chain_*.json; all eight archived group sizes; separate levels and modes. No target-based scale or run selection.",
  "estimator": "Centered population covariance in native port-load units, reconstructed from joint OLS ratios and exact fresh-RNG variance. Stream uniform {0,1,2,3,4} int64 with default_rng(fresh_seed); shuffled first consumes permutation(child_carriers/4).",
  "formulas": [
    "Vx=Vf/fresh_power_over_inherited",
    "Cxf=Vx*(response_b-joint_response_b)/joint_fresh_c",
    "Cxy=Vx*response_b",
    "Cfy=joint_response_b*Cxf+joint_fresh_c*Vf",
    "Vy=Vx*total_power_ratio",
    "V(y-bx)=Vx*innovation_power_ratio",
    "V(y-Bx-Cf)=Vx*joint_innovation_power_ratio"
  ],
  "uncertainty": "Average fresh replicates per parent schedule before descriptive parent-schedule spread. One initial parent load realization per level; child fresh draws and schedules change together. No iid cosmological standard errors.",
  "stop_rule": "Complete all input rows within 110s or raise without creating a partial success receipt.",
  "outcomes": [
    "native moments recovered and algebraic checks pass",
    "input digest, inventory, algebra or independent-anchor failure",
    "resource timeout; no successful partial result"
  ],
  "resource": "No settlement, cloud job or bulk files. Fresh chunk 6.3MB; largest shuffled permutation 10.5MB; output under 10MB.",
  "boundaries": [
    "The simulator uses observer-like bounded carrier patches, twelve local port readings, inherited records and repair moves; these scalar port-load moments have no certified geometric-volume or curvature identification.",
    "The fresh uniform {0..4} release law and replication rule are supplied simulation choices, not derived laws.",
    "A spatial linear-projection residual is not E[y|all inherited records] subtracted from y, and is not an ensemble martingale innovation.",
    "No cross-scale spatial covariance, Fourier k mapping, radiation transfer or primordial amplitude/tilt is inferred.",
    "No CMB observations or fitted cosmological inputs are consumed.",
    "Exact replay is conditional on the producer RNG semantics; archived native runs did not save fresh-array digests. An independent parent-variance receipt checks every L8 unshuffled chain at all eight scales.",
    "Shuffled mode permutes the inherited field before generating the measured inherited predictor. It removes spatial structure but need not give response_b=0; it is not a target-uncorrelated control."
  ]
